{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hollow Mine is an action roguelite with intense combat, mining, and crafting in fully destructible, procedurally generated runs. Fight through distinct biomes, loot weapons and trinkets. Shape your build with run defining abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash your way out of the bullet hell situations, use bombs and push mining carts towards enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig escape tunnels, create flanks, and harvest resources to craft upgrades mid-run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete achievements to expand your item pool and unlock new classes, stash rare finds in your hideout, and push deeper into a rich endgame of new unlocks and tougher runs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight enemies in your own style using melee combat, range weapons or magic spells!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a variety of weapons with unique play styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/a48d343592e90692abd1fee3ad020f2c.poster.avif?t=1766069919\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/a48d343592e90692abd1fee3ad020f2c.webm?t=1766069919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/a48d343592e90692abd1fee3ad020f2c.mp4?t=1766069919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft powerful weapons!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig ores and loot chests for trinkets to craft powerful weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/3b8470f6d6d8c602b7c3be4df9cd0203.avif?t=1766069919\" width=630 height=159 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up and unlock powerful abilities!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>m</strong>ore than 100 unique abilities that improve and transform your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/f1ffb51211927641865a821e5405ca6c.avif?t=1766069919\" width=630 height=354 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock and pick from multiple characters classes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and play 13 character classes. Each with its unique ability and starting equipment. 5 more mysterious characters coming soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/975865bdc209e182774af0164ac778ad.avif?t=1766069919\" width=630 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 biomes with 90+ procedurally generated rooms and plenty objectives. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 bosses with 2-staged final boss fight and over 250 items to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ weapons &amp; spells plus 100+ abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 character classes and item unlock roguelite progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snappy dash to slip through bullet-hell patterns and outplay enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hideout &amp; personal chest with persistent storage between runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items and manage them with simple inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic environments - mine walls, place bombs, and reshape the battlefield. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting system for weapons, potions and magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item shops and NPC interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced runs packed with secrets and lore. </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Enter Hollow Mine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465060/61cb4cc39c259e4d3472ed19f2ebce6719179556.jpg"},{"name":"Win Hollow Mine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465060/69fb855ccec8e85f0b8ec87d9590c1cfb74d3a4e.jpg"},{"name":"Win Hollow Mine 50","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465060/5a8bbb981d191e1a28061ae5b0feefd6c3c18f9c.jpg"},{"name":"Win Hollow Mine 100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465060/c8c1b470e1188b801c260588aa294f84e1084b64.jpg"},{"name":"Mage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465060/d8f19f485fda3a948604ebc2210812cfc5d34614.jpg"},{"name":"Knight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465060/d8f19f485fda3a948604ebc2210812cfc5d34614.jpg"},{"name":"Amazon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465060/d8f19f485fda3a948604ebc2210812cfc5d34614.jpg"},{"name":"Dwarf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465060/d8f19f485fda3a948604ebc2210812cfc5d34614.jpg"},{"name":"Rogue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465060/d8f19f485fda3a948604ebc2210812cfc5d34614.jpg"},{"name":"Mage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2465060/d8f19f485fda3a948604ebc2210812cfc5d34614.jpg"}],"total":96},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2465060?t=1766069919","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2465060?t=1766069919","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co