ttps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/a48d343592e90692abd1fee3ad020f2c.mp4?t=1766069919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft powerful weapons!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig ores and loot chests for trinkets to craft powerful weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/3b8470f6d6d8c602b7c3be4df9cd0203.avif?t=1766069919\" width=630 height=159 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up and unlock powerful abilities!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>m</strong>ore than 100 unique abilities that improve and transform your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/f1ffb51211927641865a821e5405ca6c.avif?t=1766069919\" width=630 height=354 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock and pick from multiple characters classes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and play 13 character classes. Each with its unique ability and starting equipment. 5 more mysterious characters coming soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/extras/975865bdc209e182774af0164ac778ad.avif?t=1766069919\" width=630 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 biomes with 90+ procedurally generated rooms and plenty objectives. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 bosses with 2-staged final boss fight and over 250 items to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ weapons &amp; spells plus 100+ abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 character classes and item unlock roguelite progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snappy dash to slip through bullet-hell patterns and outplay enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hideout &amp; personal chest with persistent storage between runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items and manage them with simple inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic environments - mine walls, place bombs, and reshape the battlefield. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting system for weapons, potions and magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item shops and NPC interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced runs packed with secrets and lore. </p></li></ul>","developers":["Micha\u0142 Parysz"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465060/header.jpg?t=1766069919","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2465060/1144339599/70be607ee0c42bfcabf592d2ca4e0128a3c66ea0/1765826861/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766069917","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2465060/1144339599/70be607ee0c42bfcabf592d2ca4e0128a3c66ea0/1765826861/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766069917","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2465060/1144339599/70be607ee0c42bfcabf592d2ca4e0128a3c66ea0/1765826861/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766069917","id":257250288,"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/